        "zh": "developer-portfolios 是一个精选的开发者个人作品集网站列表，旨在为你构建自己的作品集提供灵感。它汇集了真实开发者的网站，展示了多样化的设计、布局和内容策略。该仓库以简单的列表形式呈现，方便浏览和学习。你可以通过浏览列表收集创意，分析常见模式，或直接链接到作品集作为参考。将其作为起点，设计一个能体现你独特技能和个性的作品集。",
        "es": "developer-portfolios is a curated collection of real developer portfolio websites, serving as inspiration for building your own. It showcases diverse designs, layouts, and content strategies from actual developers. The repository is a simple list, making it easy to browse and learn from peers. You can explore the list to gather ideas, analyze common patterns, or directly link to portfolios for reference. Use it as a starting point to design a portfolio that reflects your unique skills and personality.",
