      "summaries": {
        "en": "Hermes WebUI is a browser-based interface for Hermes Agent, making advanced AI agent capabilities accessible from any device. It wraps the Hermes agent framework in a clean, responsive web UI that works on desktop and mobile. The key insight is its use of WebSockets for real-time agent interaction, enabling seamless streaming responses. You can deploy it locally or on a server to experiment with autonomous task execution, tool use, and multi-step reasoning. Try it to build your own AI assistant or automate workflows without coding a UI from scratch.",
        "zh": "Hermes WebUI 是为 Hermes Agent 打造的浏览器界面，让你在任何设备上都能轻松使用先进的 AI 智能体。它通过简洁、响应式的 Web 界面封装了 Hermes 智能体框架，支持桌面和手机。其核心技术亮点是使用 WebSocket 实现实时交互，让智能体的流式响应无缝呈现。你可以本地部署或在服务器上运行，体验自主任务执行、工具调用和多步推理。尝试用它来构建自己的 AI 助手或自动化工作流，无需从头编写 UI 代码。",
        "es": "Hermes WebUI is a browser-based interface for Hermes Agent, making advanced AI agent capabilities accessible from any device. It wraps the Hermes agent framework in a clean, responsive web UI that works on desktop and mobile. The key insight is its use of WebSockets for real-time agent interaction, enabling seamless streaming responses. You can deploy it locally or on a server to experiment with autonomous task execution, tool use, and multi-step reasoning. Try it to build your own AI assistant or automate workflows without coding a UI from scratch.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "hermes-webui stands out for agent, ai-agents, and hermes in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Hermes WebUI is a browser-based interface for Hermes Agent, making advanced AI agent capabilities accessible from any device. It wraps the Hermes agent framework in a clean, responsive web UI that works on desktop and mobile. The key insight is its use of WebSockets for real-time agent interaction, enabling seamless streaming responses. You can deploy it locally or on a server to experiment with autonomous task execution, tool use, and multi-step reasoning. Try it to build your own AI assistant or automate workflows without coding a UI from scratch.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/nesquena/hermes-webui for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
